## Key Findings

- **Total Orders**: 96,477 orders processed
- **Total Revenue**: R$15,422,461.77
- **Average Order Value**: R$153.07
- **Top Revenue Category**: health_beauty (R$1,258,681.34)
- **Payment Method**: credit_card dominates with 76,505 orders
- **Delivery Performance**: 89,139 on-time (4.29 avg score) vs 10,853 late (2.35 avg score)
- **State Leader**: SP (Sao Paulo) with R$5,998,226.96 revenue

